    "introduction": "Auto Trader operates a digital automotive marketplace connecting vehicle buyers with retailers and private sellers in the UK. Dealers pay for advertising and related tools that help them present stock, understand pricing and manage their online presence. Consumers use the platform to compare vehicles and research potential purchases, creating the audience that makes it useful to sellers. Additional activities include services related to vehicle leasing and transactions. The business relies on attracting a broad selection of stock and a large pool of prospective buyers. Dealer profitability, vehicle supply and the effectiveness of its software products influence demand for its paid services.",
